d":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱，还省下钙片、维生素 D 和天天熬汤的钱和工夫。要做的只是查出缺了再补，不缺就不额外补。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["先看维生素 D。2023 年一篇系统综述收了 14 项研究、2734 名骨折病人。作者的结论是，单补维生素 D 对骨头愈合、长没长上和恢复后的功能影响很小。看出好处的几项研究，质量普遍偏低。作者写明，只算随机分组的试验，没有一项看出补了有好处。其中一项找了 100 名维 D 偏低的长骨骨折病人。一半人伤后两周内一次吃 10 万 IU，一半人吃安慰剂（假药）。两边各有 2 人骨头没长上，合起来是 4%。另一项找了 102 名 18 到 50 岁的大腿骨或小腿骨骨折病人，分四组吃不同剂量或安慰剂。3 个月和 12 个月时，愈合评分都没看出差别。还有一项找了 32 名手腕骨折的绝经后女性。和不补的人比，每天折合 1800 IU 的大剂量组，骨头的抗压硬度反而更低。再看钙。2014 年一篇系统综述说，看维 D 不足或补维 D 怎么影响骨折愈合的临床研究很少，结论说不清。它找到的两项研究是钙和维 D 一起补。看到的是骨折处骨密度或骨痂（新长出来的骨头）多了，没看愈合快慢。最后看骨头汤。台湾高雄一项测定买了三种骨头汤面食，一份汤 450 到 550 克。每份汤里的钙平均 14 到 39 毫克，占每天 1000 毫克推荐量的 1.4% 到 3.9%。作者的结论是，一份汤的钙不到每天推荐量的 5%。中国的推荐量是 18 到 49 岁每天 800 毫克，50 岁以上 1000 毫克，每天上限 2000 毫克。定这些数的卫生行业标准还写明，长期吃过量的钙会增加得肾结石的风险。美国一项试验找了 36282 名绝经后女性，每天吃 1000 毫克钙加 400 IU 维 D，平均跟踪 7 年。肾结石风险高约 17%（HR 1.17，95% CI 1.02–1.34，可信范围）。髋部骨折低约 12%，但不显著（HR 0.88，0.72–1.08）。它看起来划算，是因为「骨头是钙做的，多吃钙就长得快」这个直觉"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Gatt T, Grech A, Arshad H (2023). The Effect of Vitamin D Supplementation for Bone Healing in Fracture Patients: A Systematic Review. Advances in Orthopedics, 2023, 6236045. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1155/2023/6236045","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1155/2023/6236045"]},"；Haines N, Kempton LB, Seymour RB, et al. (2017). The effect of a single early high-dose vitamin D supplement on fracture union in patients with hypovitaminosis D: a prospective randomised trial. Bone & Joint Journal, 99-B(11), 1520-1525. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1302/0301-620X.99B11.BJJ-2017-0271.R1","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1302/0301-620X.99B11.BJJ-2017-0271.R1"]},"；Slobogean GP, Bzovsky S, O'Hara NN, et al. (2023). Effect of Vitamin D3 Supplementation on Acute Fracture Healing: A Phase II Screening Randomized Double-Blind Controlled Trial. JBMR Plus, 7, e10705. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1002/jbm4.10705","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1002/jbm4.10705"]},"；Heyer FL, de Jong JJ, Willems PC, et al. (2021). The Effect of Bolus Vitamin D3 Supplementation on Distal Radius Fracture Healing: A Randomized Controlled Trial Using HR-pQCT. Journal of Bone and Mineral Research, 36, 1492-1501. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1002/jbmr.4311","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1002/jbmr.4311"]},"；Gorter EA, Hamdy NA, Appelman-Dijkstra NM, Schipper IB (2014). The role of vitamin D in human fracture healing: a systematic review of the literature. Bone, 64, 288-297. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.bone.2014.04.026","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/j.bone.2014.04.026"]},"；Hsu DJ, Lee CW, Tsai WC, Chien YC (2017). Essential and toxic metals in animal bone broths. Food & Nutrition Research, 61, 1347478（表 2、表 3）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1080/16546628.2017.1347478","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1080/16546628.2017.1347478"]},"；国家卫生和计划生育委员会 (2018). WS/T 578.2—2018 中国居民膳食营养素参考摄入量 第 2 部分：常量元素（表 1；定义 3.7）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.nhc.gov.cn/wjw/yingyang/201805/f2c614be95fe41dba8123c23a6e6fb55/files/1739783539207_73894.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.nhc.gov.cn/wjw/yingyang/201805/f2c614be95fe41dba8123c23a6e6fb55/files/1739783539207_73894.pdf"]},"；Jackson RD, LaCroix AZ, Gass M, et al. (2006). Calcium plus vitamin D supplementation and the risk of fractures. New England Journal of Medicine, 354(7), 669-683. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJMoa055218","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJMoa055218"]},"；Doetsch AM, Faber J, Lynnerup N, et al. (2004). The effect of calcium and vitamin D3 supplementation on the healing of the proximal humerus fracture: a randomized placebo-controlled study. Calcified Tissue International, 75, 183-188. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00223-004-0167-0","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1007/s00223-004-0167-0"]},"（备注里那项）；Gorter EA, Krijnen P, Schipper IB (2017). Vitamin D status and adult fracture healing. Journal of Clinical Orthopaedics and Trauma, 8(1), 34-37. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcot.2016.09.003","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcot.2016.09.003"]},"（备注里那项）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["争议：有两处小苗头。丹麦一项试验找了 30 名上臂近肩处骨折的老年女性，她们有骨质疏松或骨量偏低。每天吃 800 IU 维 D 加 1 克钙的人，第 6 周骨折处骨密度更高（0.623 对 0.570 g/cm²）。但它只量了骨密度，没看骨头长没长好，人也太少。那项 102 人的试验事后拆开看，大剂量维 D 的人功能评分略好，作者说还要再做试验确认。本来就缺维 D 的人另说。荷兰一项跟踪记录里，补了以后仍然缺的人，愈合拖慢的占 9.7%。本来不缺的人占 0.3%，补上来的人占 1.7%。这只是跟踪记录，证明不了因果。查出缺了，按医生说的补到正常。已经确诊骨质疏松、或者轻轻一摔就骨折的人，要的是抗骨质疏松药，见第 1 节第 40 条（抗骨质疏松药），钙片代替不了它。不缺维 D 的人长期补没有好处，见本节第 3 条（补维生素 D）。要否掉的是「额外猛补」，不是少吃钙，三餐里的钙照常吃够，见本节第 21 条（防肾结石把钙戒掉）。刚摔了怀疑骨折怎么办，见第 13 节第 41 条（怀疑骨折）。收益定中，是按一年钙片和维 D 的钱算的。受益人是你自己。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/06-29"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"不要指望学会「正确搬运姿势」、上搬运培训就能防腰痛，要减的是搬的重量和次数，平时多锻炼"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/06-31"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"不要指望靠 AI 聊天机器人自己判断病情和法律问题，看病、打官司、花大钱之前，把它说的依据找到原文核一遍"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-23"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要指望买东西改善心情或身份感"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["把钱和物质看得越重的人，自己觉得越不幸福，但关联很弱，也分不出谁导致谁。还有研究发现，花钱买一段经历比买东西更让人快乐。所以同样花钱，花在一次出门这类经历上，比…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-24"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要为了「在周围人里往上挪一档」多花钱换房、换车、换圈子"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["拿收入一样的人来比，邻居挣得越多，这个人报告的幸福感越低。这主要发生在学历和自己相同的邻居身上，常和邻居来往的人更明显。所以为了搬进一个人人都比你宽裕的地方而多…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-25"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要相信「意志力像肌肉，用一会儿就没了」"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["流行的说法是：先做一件费自控的事，接下来就更容易破功，所以要省着用意志力。23 个实验室、2141 人按同一套方案重做了这个实验，结果几乎是零。别再用「今天意志…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-26"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要指望吃早餐或 16:8 轻断食帮你控制体重，吃饭时间挑你能长期坚持的"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["流行说法是不吃早餐会让人午饭晚饭暴食，一天总量反而更多。试验里不是这样：不吃早餐的人一天少吃了两百多千卡，体重还略轻一点。16:8 和单纯少吃比，一年下来体重也…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-27"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要相信「手淫伤身」「戒色才能变好」，真正要看的是有没有耽误睡觉、工作和关系"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["没看到手淫伤身的证据。射精多的男性前列腺癌少约两成，但也有研究看到年轻时次数多的人风险偏高。少数人每次射精后都会没力气、像感冒，几天才好，这是一种罕见病，可以去…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-28"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要花钱做「性取向矫正」「同性恋治疗」，也不要把家里人送去"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["美国心理学会的专家组看完研究后说，这类矫正改不了性取向，还可能伤人。美国一项调查里，做过矫正的人有过自杀念头的多了近九成。国内有精神病院以「性偏好障碍」为名强制…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/06"},"children":["阅读整个主题：反面清单 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"},"children":[]}]},{"t